From: E200 Community Firmware <community@example.invalid>
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] iiod: opt-in E200 RX DMA prefetch and TCP zero-copy

Source: libiio da72b6193911e8fc242422bea5bef90e23c3577d (0.26)
This independent profile retains the standard network protocol. E200_IQ24=1
selects a single RX client, 32 1-MiB DMA blocks and CPU0/CPU1 overlap. RX1
requests >=262144 complex samples use the fast path; smaller requests retain
the normal libiio implementation. No TX behavior is added or validated.
Requires the separate experimental page-backed kernel allocator.
Not submitted upstream; not a general-purpose libiio optimization.

